# Rust
rust/**/target/
rust/**/*.rs.bk
# Cargo.lock IS committed. This workspace ships binaries (trust-core,
# credential-vault, kill-switch, defstack-cli), where Cargo'''s own guidance is to
# commit it -- and the repository claims SLSA provenance, which a floating
# dependency resolution would quietly contradict. npm lockfiles were already
# committed; this removes the inconsistency.
# Only the workspace root has a lockfile. Nested ones are Cargo artifacts that the
# workspace ignores, and committing one invites edits to a file nothing reads.
#
# `rust/*/Cargo.lock` matched exactly one directory level, so rust/trust-core/fuzz/Cargo.lock
# slipped past it and was committed -- a second, unsynchronised pin of ed25519-dalek and
# curve25519-dalek governing the signature_decode fuzz target, with nothing keeping it aligned
# with the workspace. `**` catches it at any depth.
rust/**/Cargo.lock
!rust/Cargo.lock

# Python
**/__pycache__/
**/*.pyc
python/**/.pytest_cache/
python/**/.ruff_cache/
python/**/.venv/
python/**/venv/
python/**/*.egg-info/
python/**/build/
python/**/dist/

# TypeScript / Node
typescript/**/node_modules/
typescript/**/dist/
typescript/**/build/
typescript/**/.next/
typescript/**/out/
typescript/**/npm-debug.log*
typescript/**/yarn-error.log*

# Go
go/**/*.test
go/**/*.out

# IDE / OS
.vscode/
.idea/
*.swp
*.swo
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

# Secrets / local config (NEVER commit)
.env
.env.*
*.key
*.pem
secrets/

# Build outputs
*.log
coverage/
.coverage
htmlcov/
.pytest_cache/

# Transient audit virtualenv
.auditvenv/
# Anchored to the repository root on purpose. Unanchored, `evidence/` matches at ANY
# depth -- it silently swallowed rust/evidence/, a real workspace member, so every
# `cargo metadata` in CI failed with 'no such file or directory' and took rustfmt,
# clippy and the conformance matrix down with it.
/evidence/

# Agent hook state -- per-session scratch containing local absolute paths.
# Never useful to a contributor and noise in a public repo.
.mimosa/
**/.mimosa/

# TypeScript incremental build info
*.tsbuildinfo
